msgid "Preferred Sync Ref"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../sound/cards/hdspm.rst:135
msgid "Name -- \"Preferred Sync Reference\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../sound/cards/hdspm.rst:139
msgid "Values -- \"Word\" \"MADI\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../sound/cards/hdspm.rst:142
msgid ""
"Within the Auto-sync-Mode the preferred Sync Source can be chosen. If it is "
"not available another is used if possible."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../sound/cards/hdspm.rst:146
msgid ""
"Since MADI has a much higher bit-rate than word-clock, the card should "
"synchronise better in MADI Mode. But since the RME-PLL is very good, there "
"are almost no problems with word-clock too. I never found a difference."
msgstr ""

