#: ../../../sound/cards/hdspm.rst:218
msgid ""
"Here as a first value the channel-index is taken to get/set the "
"corresponding mixer channel, where 0-63 are the input to output fader and "
"64-127 the playback to outputs fader. Value 0 is channel muted 0 and 32768 "
"an amplification of 1."
msgstr ""

